{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/kocj3d","slideIndex":3,"text":"0:40. React Native renders the interface, and React Navigation controls tabs and stacks. The map and location packages provide the building blocks for turf boundaries and GPS updates. AsyncStorage holds local sign-in state. On the server, Express defines the routes and the pg driver communicates with PostgreSQL. Xcode and the iOS simulator support the demo, Metro serves the development bundle, and Git tracks code changes."}
