{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/cm01mb","slideIndex":7,"text":"0:45. The profile summarizes the signed-in user’s sessions, distance, steps and owned turfs. The Achievements screen displays goals and progress, including First Capture, Big Capture, Marathon Session, Marathon Runner and Turf Tycoon. The screenshots are captured while signed in as User1. The four seeded runners account for the demo activity, so User1’s personal stats and trophies are at zero.\nScreenshots: User1 on the iPhone 17e simulator, profile.png and achievements.png.\nUser1 can open the bell on the map to review notifications. The captured screen shows friend-request alerts. Individual alerts can be marked read, and there is also a Mark All Read action.\nScreenshot: User1 on the iPhone 17e simulator, notifications.png."}
