{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/s6pt0v","slideIndex":8,"text":"0:55. The original Render database stopped responding. I initialized a replacement and verified access from the Mac with the external TLS endpoint. The simulator was sluggish with two devices running and heavy swap on my MacBook Neo, so I used one simulator. Notifications originally overlapped the notch and then shifted the map, so I moved them behind a bell and corrected the navigation labels. One test setup issue remains. Jest stops before executing tests because it cannot load the current React Navigation modules. The TypeScript check passes."}
